[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9843.429, "timestamp": "02:44:03", "text": "24チャンネル"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9847.349, "timestamp": "02:44:07", "text": "ライブ配信される予定で私もライブ配信します"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9850.469, "timestamp": "02:44:10", "text": "しかし、将来的には"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9853.91, "timestamp": "02:44:13", "text": "私が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9856.63, "timestamp": "02:44:16", "text": "それは[鼻で笑う]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9858.71, "timestamp": "02:44:18", "text": "なぜ手動でカットする必要があるのですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9861.269, "timestamp": "02:44:21", "text": "沈黙？ AIは沈黙していると思った"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 9870.022, "timestamp": "02:44:30", "author": "@abhaynair7276", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m3_pcx7bakRsuScPVawS3lNZlHTFLM8XHTpdd1EGU=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "is it just me that when I hear my voice I die hearing it out of embarrassment"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9870.469, "timestamp": "02:44:30", "text": "24時間配信は一時停止されますが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9876.389, "timestamp": "02:44:36", "text": "すぐにライブになります。だから、Ahを見るたびに"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9878.23, "timestamp": "02:44:38", "text": "自分の声を聞くと死んでしまうのは私だけ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9880.79, "timestamp": "02:44:40", "text": "聞いてるよ うん、私もだよ。私も。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9884.55, "timestamp": "02:44:44", "text": "これに慣れました。少し時間がかかりました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9887.19, "timestamp": "02:44:47", "text": "それはまだ私はまだ嫌いです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9892.79, "timestamp": "02:44:52", "text": "[咳払い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9897.75, "timestamp": "02:44:57", "text": "ええと、私はあなたが今そのことをしなければならないと思っています"}]